# Solid concrete block with a wooden top, for Godot TileSet terrains in
# "Match Sides" mode. Frame block_NN has NN = sum of connected sides:
# N=1, E=2, S=4, W=8 (block_00 = isolated, block_15 = fully inside).
# Exposed tops get the floor boards, so one terrain paints whole platforms.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_terrain_block.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_terrain_block_x4.png 4
@columns 4

